{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 You awaken disoriented, tattooed and abandoned in a hellish warzone with no memory of how you arrived. The distant gunfire is the least of your worries as glowing-eyed cultists emerge from the shadows, their unintelligible screams pierce the chaos as they charge clumsily toward you.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>\u00a0 </i></strong><i>Find out what you're made of in this <strong>unique blend of RNG and skill-based progression</strong></i><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/guystryingtorepairfgif.gif?t=1748026090\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/combatdsmallgif.gif?t=1748026090\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Survive</strong> as long as you can and <strong>command your rats</strong> to <strong>explode corpses</strong> of slain enemies to improve your chances of survival <br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/rateatssss.gif?t=1748026090\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/corpseexplodgifdgdf1123123.gif?t=1748026090\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Compete</strong> in the <strong>Global Leaderboards</strong> to fight for the\u00a0 top rank of the &quot;Highest Wave Survived&quot; or the high score in the <strong>Basketball Minigame</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/basketballgif.gif?t=1748026090\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Drink</strong> from the <strong>Cream Machine</strong> to build your character in unique ways</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/creammachinegf-2.gif?t=1748026090\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022Six unique weapons (M1 Garand, M1A1 Thompson, Walther PPK, Combat Knife, Trenchgun, and Kar98) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022Blood, gore/dismemberment, custom procedural animation, and enemy AI was designed from the ground-up to make every play session feel unique and satisfying </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2665020?t=1748026090","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748026090","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/0f4bcc20e1b4748e3c6096a71f571ecda41966d0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748026090","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/0f4bcc20e1b4748e3c6096a71f571ecda41966d0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748026090","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Milo contains graphic violence and gore. You use various weapons to attack and there are rats that eat corpses. "},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2691620,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 You awaken disoriented, tattooed and