.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/creammachinegf-2.gif?t=1748026090\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022Six unique weapons (M1 Garand, M1A1 Thompson, Walther PPK, Combat Knife, Trenchgun, and Kar98) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022Blood, gore/dismemberment, custom procedural animation, and enemy AI was designed from the ground-up to make every play session feel unique and satisfying </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Spencer Sharp","rat cream games LLC","Yarrawah Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/header.jpg?t=1748026090","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257091019,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257091019/movie480.mp4?t=1748015499","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257091019/movie_max.mp4?t=1748015499"},"name":"Milo Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257091019/04101e5ef34f29d7b94a64a87444cb393d655ad4/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748015499","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257091019/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1748015499","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257091019/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1748015499"}}],"name":"Milo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating sy